      "message": "I think it should be _both_. I think `headerJarFile` becomes the output of jarjar-ing if `jarjar_rules` is not empty. With trunk stable, we introduced an additional `repackagedHeaderJarFile` to prevent collisions of aconfig flags on the bootclasspath/systemserverclasspath. \n\nSince both of them are on the [classpath](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/build/soong/+/1220e589df1db2861e73f21d69977225ad5a20d2:java/base.go;l\u003d2273-2277;drc\u003d5866fc2d42638a3a055fd2b64f77aa8ed7abf22a;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0), I have updated the patchset to include `repackagedHeaderJarFile` as well.",
